    "body": "<h2 id=\"01H8HG9Z2YBBY5QCDHDBQ6S6XR\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to locate a list's subscribe link, which you can share with potential email subscribers to enable them to sign up for your email marketing. </p>\n<p>A subscribe page is a Klaviyo-hosted sign-up page that is automatically created for every list in your account. While you may choose to leverage popups, flyouts, or embedded forms on your website, you can also share a link to this subscribe page in emails or social media posts as an alternative way to grow your email list. </p>\n<h2 id=\"01H8HG9Z2YRX99KWRA1N9T0X3F\">Find the subscribe link for your list</h2>\n<p>To find the subscribe link for a list:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the Audience dropdown in the left hand navigation.</li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Lists &amp; Segments</strong> tab.</li>\n<li>Click into a list. Check the <em>Type</em> column to ensure you're selecting a list, not a segment. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720770156187\" alt=\"Audience type column.jpg\" width=\"698\" height=\"112\"><br>\n</li>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Signup Forms</strong> tab.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720758255259\" alt=\"The signup forms tab of a Klaviyo list\" width=\"586\" height=\"110\">\n</li>\n<li>Scroll down to the <em>Subscribe Page</em> section at the bottom of the page. </li>\n<li>If you see a list of consent pages, click <strong>Subscribe page</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720758257307\" alt=\"subscribe page.jpg\" width=\"717\" height=\"89\">\n<ol>\n<li>On the following page, in the modal to the left of the subscribe page editor, click <strong>Copy URL</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720758259099\" alt=\"copy subscribe url.jpg\" width=\"303\" height=\"331\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>If you don't see a list of consent pages, click <strong>Copy Subscribe Page URL</strong>. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720758262299\" alt=\"copy subscribe url default pages.jpg\" width=\"639\" height=\"200\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>After following these steps, the URL will be copied to your clipboard and you can paste it wherever you’d like.</p>\n<h2 id=\"01H8HG9Z2Z2TT7TFACZB2KTR5Z\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360035312491\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Guide to advanced segmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005078267\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Guide to unsubscribes in Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059544911\">How to collect consent via Instagram</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
